# webapps.catalog — Omarchy webapps of the "apps" module (type WEB).
#
# One catalog per type (gui / tui / webapps), read by the "apps" module
# (setup-apps.sh dispatcher + webapps/setup-webapps.sh). Each line keeps
# the type prefix so the backup selection format (apps.selected) stays
# identical whatever the catalog:
#
#   WEB <name> | <url> | <icon>  → Omarchy webapp (omarchy webapp install)
#   WEB <name> | native:<pkg> | <icon>
#                              → desktop package kept in this catalog (yay);
#                                an optional native-<pkg>.sh hook runs after
#                                install / before removal (config patching).
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with "#" are ignored.
# The actual selection is saved by the backup (mosquitomarchy-setup.sh --backup) in apps.selected.

WEB kSuite|https://ksuite.infomaniak.com/all/kdrive/app/drive/1099475/files/5|ksuite
WEB Schwung Manager|http://move.local:7700|schwung-manager
WEB TIDAL Hi-Fi (TidaLuna)|native:tidal-hifi-tidaluna|tidal-hifi
